        c='personal'; note='Dana confirmed trip was for cousin’s wedding, with no business purpose.'
    elif 'SOUTHWEST AIR 526 AUS-SFO' in d or 'HOTEL ZEPHYR' in d:
        c='business_expense'; line='24a'; note='Assumed business travel to DesignWeek conference; purpose and reimbursement unconfirmed.'
